["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">謎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>谜；谜题；谜语；提示；线索</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">メイ・ベイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なぞ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なぞ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谜语；谜题；谜团；神秘事物；神秘的；谜一样的；莫测的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謎謎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なぞなぞ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谜语；谜题；谜团</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">挨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>靠近；推开</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひら.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挨拶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">问候；招呼；礼节用语；致辞；贺词；回答；回应；礼节性拜访；报复；复仇；岂有此理的话；说得好听；禅宗印证；人际关系；往来；调停；斡旋；中间人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">餌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>饵料；诱饵；食物；猎物；诱惑（利益）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ・ニ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">え・えば・えさ・もち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">餌</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えさ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">饲料；饵料；宠物食物；鱼饵；诱饵；诱惑物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">膝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>膝盖；膝部（大腿与小腿间的关节）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひざ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">膝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひざ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">膝盖；大腿上部（坐时）；膝盖及大腿</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">諦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>放弃；真相；明确；真实</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ・タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あきら.める・つまびらか・まこと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">諦める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あきらめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">放弃</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">諦め</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あきらめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">放弃；认命；安慰</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">僅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>一点点</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン・ゴン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わず.か</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">僅か</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わずか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少量；少许；微小；轻微；狭窄的（差距）；仅仅；只是；不过；不超过</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">戚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>亲属；悲伤；忧愁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソク・セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いた.む・うれ.える・みうち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">親戚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">亲戚；亲属；亲人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>逼近；迫近</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">せま.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挨拶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">问候；招呼；礼节用语；致辞；贺词；回答；回应；礼节性拜访；报复；复仇；岂有此理的话；说得好听；禅宗印证；人际关系；往来；调停；斡旋；中间人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">溺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>溺水；沉溺；溺爱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">デキ・ジョウ・ニョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いばり・おぼ.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">溺れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おぼれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">溺水；沉入水中无法呼吸；快要淹死；沉溺于；为某事物失去理智；上瘾；沉湎于</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">籠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>笼子；篮子；闭居；专心于；包含</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ・ル</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かご・こ.める・こも.る・こ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">籠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">篮子；筐；笼子</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">傾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>倾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かたむ（く）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">傾向</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倾向</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">傾く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたむく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倾斜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">象</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>象</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ・ゾウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">印象</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印象</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">対象</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">对象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">効</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>效</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き（く）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">効果</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">效果</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">効く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">有效</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">率</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>率</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リツ・ソツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひき（いる）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">確率</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくりつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">概率</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">率いる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひきいる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">率领</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">姿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>姿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すがた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">姿勢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">姿势；态度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">姿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すがた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">身影；样子</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勢</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>势</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いきお（い）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勢い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いきおい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">气势；势头</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大勢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おおぜい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">很多人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">維</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>维</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">維持</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">维持</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繊維</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纤维</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">普</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>普</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">普通</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">普通</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">普段</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平时</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">及</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>及</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">およ（ぶ）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">普及</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">普及</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">及ぼす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">およぼす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使……受到（影响）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">需</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>需</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">需要</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">需求</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">必需品</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひつじゅひん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">必需品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">給</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>给</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">供給</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">供给</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">給料</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工资</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">源</div><d